d and  so that's just it's a high high standard  and I think that if you feel like now  that doesn't prevent if I feel like  there's been a pass interference or that  wasn't interference that I'm throwing  the challenge flag and then I'm gonna be  pissed off if I wasn't right hey before  I let you go you've got the post season  looming and I know you haven't gotten  your berth yet so this is a hypothetical  assuming that you make it to the  playoffs will you approach the playoffs  any differently given the way that the  post season ended for your team each of  the last two years  man we played well III don't I mean I  would not change my preparations for the  post season based on the play digs made  in Minnesota that would be madness and  then I think no I like the way this  team's prepared I'd like the way this  team has been kind of fought through  some adversity and and you know  hopefully fortunately if we're able to  get into that position I think we'll  have a plan on how we prepare each  preach game but holy cow that's that's  the other thing back to the analytics so  often you make adjustments and you got  to make sure you're fixing the right  part and you're not just fixing a  muffler and you got a tire problem coach  we wish you the best moving forward the  rest of the season we look forward to  seeing on NBC next Thursday night in  Atlanta taking on the Falcons and we  look forward also seeing you in the  postseason this year congratulations on  all your success this season and hope to  talk to you again real soon  thanks a bunch Mike appreciate you  hi I'm Mike Tirico and thanks for  watching make sure to hit subscribe for  the latest news and highlights from NBC  Sports
 

